urvivors that stand in their way, hide, scavenge, fight and survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEAM BATTLE ROYALE:</strong>  <br>Play with your friends as squads of up to 5 players and lead your team to victory and be the last team standing against 9 other teams!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOTS:</strong>  <br>Our game supports a very advanced bot system, if there are not enough real players online to join the match, the game will connect advanced bots that react exactly like real players to keep every match with exactly 50 players. They will join the match with custom names, they can run, shoot, aim, jump, dodge, hide, camp everything real players can do, so this game will never die Even though there are no online players overall, the game is still fun to play against extremely intelligent bots.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors, what are you waiting for? Join us now on an endless journey of fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790190/extras/50767d6d00e91dfa4d34df79b49f2c08.poster.avif?t=1760373541\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790190/extras/50767d6d00e91dfa4d34df79b49f2c08.webm?t=1760373541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790190/extras/50767d6d00e91dfa4d34df79b49f2c08.mp4?t=1760373541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  \ud83d\udc96 You saw the trailer. You felt the hype<strong>?</strong><br>Please <strong>Add the game to your Wishlist</strong> to stay updated and help shape its future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It really supports the game's development \u2014 thank you! \ud83d\ude4f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted